## Problem classes

### `NotificationPermission on FGS update`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Lint `NotificationPermission` on `NotificationManager.notify` despite manifest `POST_NOTIFICATIONS` | Lint requires a runtime check for `notify()` when targetSdk ≥ 33; declaration alone is not enough | For VPN FGS content updates, call `startForeground` again (same notification id) instead of `notify`. Keep `POST_NOTIFICATIONS` in the manifest for non-FGS posts / future UI. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Multi-net leak in VPN runtime`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Second ZT net still on TUN | `rebuildVpn()` still walks all OK configs | Filter to orchestrator `vpnNetworkId`; `leave()` others on Node |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Background VPN prompt`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| AUTO wants VPN, dialog never shows / crashes | `prepare()` from FGS/callback | Stay PROXY/OFF; sticky "Grant VPN"; Activity-only prepare |

